relationship: RO:0002292 http://identifiers.org/ensembl/ENSMUSG00000059187 ! expresses Fam19a1 (Mmus)
relationship: RO:0015004 PCL:0012502 ! has characterizing marker set NS forest marker set of Lamp5-like Egln3_1 MOp (Mouse).
relationship: RO:HOM0000007 PCL:0015158 ! (Mouse Sncg)-like_C4 primary motor cortex GABAergic interneuron (Hsap)
relationship: RO:HOM0000007 PCL:0019123 ! (Mouse Sncg)-like_C4 primary motor cortex GABAergic interneuron (Cjac)
