is_a: PCL:0019095 ! (Mouse Lamp5)-like primary motor cortex GABAergic interneuron (Cjac)
relationship: RO:0002292 http://identifiers.org/ncbigene/100394853 {xref="PMID:34616066"} ! expresses COL5A2 (Cjac)
relationship: RO:0002292 http://identifiers.org/ncbigene/100408865 ! expresses TOX3 (Cjac)
relationship: RO:0002292 http://identifiers.org/ncbigene/100409063 ! expresses GLIS3 (Cjac)
relationship: RO:0002292 http://identifiers.org/ncbigene/100410437 {xref="PMID:34616066"} ! expresses LAMP5 (Cjac)
relationship: RO:0015004 PCL:0020502 ! has characterizing marker set NS forest marker set of Inh LAMP5 COL5A2 M1 (Marmoset).
relationship: RO:HOM0000007 PCL:0015157 ! (Mouse Lamp5)-like_C5 primary motor cortex GABAergic interneuron (Hsap)
