[Term]
id: UBERON:0000203
name: pallium
namespace: uberon
alt_id: UBERON:0007333
def: "Dorsal part (roof region) of the telencephalon[GO]." [GO:0021543, https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/287, ISBN:0471888893, Wikipedia:Pallium_(neuroanatomy)]
