intersection_of: UBERON:0000475 ! organism subdivision
intersection_of: RO:0002551 UBERON:0003277 ! has skeleton skeleton of upper jaw
disjoint_from: UBERON:0001710 ! lower jaw region
relationship: BFO:0000050 UBERON:0004089 ! part of midface
