[Term]
id: UBERON:0001737
name: larynx
namespace: uberon
def: "A continuation of the pharynx that is involved in breathing, sound production, and protecting the trachea against food aspiration." [http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, Wikipedia:Larynx]
