property_value: UBPROP:0000001 "In a vascular plexus, the contents of the vessels mix. A plexus allows blood to flow via multiple routes. If one branch of the plexus is obstructed, the blood may flow via the open branches[Wikipedia:Plexus#Circulatory_system]." xsd:string {source="Wikipedia:Plexus#Circulatory_system"}

