[Term]
id: UBERON:0006660
name: muscular coat
namespace: uberon
def: "A region of muscle in many organs in the vertebrate body, adjacent to the submucosa membrane. It is responsible for gut movement such as peristalsis." [Wikipedia:Muscular_layer]
